        <!-- Common Mistakes Section -->
        <div class="mt-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6">
            Common Paint Sprayer Rental Mistakes
          </h2>

          <p>
            Renting a sprayer is good value on a big job and a poor deal on a small one, and the costs that decide which is which are not on the rental board.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-6 my-8">
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Not Counting Cleaning Time in the Rental Window</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Airless sprayers take real time to flush and clean, and rental clocks do not stop while you do it. A "four-hour" rental is often three hours of spraying. Budget the cleanup into the window, or you end up paying for an extra day.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Forgetting the Consumables</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Tips, filters, masking, extension hose, and the extra paint that spraying consumes all add up, and they are not in the headline rate. On a small job those extras can exceed the rental itself and tip the maths back toward a brush and roller.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Renting Without Testing First</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                A rented machine is an unfamiliar machine, and the first surface you spray should not be the front of your house. Spray cardboard until the fan pattern is even and your pace is right — twenty minutes of practice saves hours of sanding back runs.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Renting Repeatedly Instead of Buying</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Two or three rentals in a season usually cost more than a decent homeowner-grade sprayer. If you have a house exterior, a fence, and a deck ahead of you, run the numbers on buying before booking the third rental.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-16 text-center bg-blue-50 p-12 rounded-3xl border border-blue-100 shadow-inner">
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6">Rent Smart, Spray Smart</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
